{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "1535ebfa7492ef6c175a1ce71dd5cb9bc1c5086273fb8d68c6b62398a430f440", "ja": "あっという間の海外ロケでしたね～！\n{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでした♪", "zh": "到国外出外景的行程转眼间就结束了呢～！\n{$P$}先生，辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f57e6a2012fc404e7b8016cda5f1cf916fcc7a344ed6c2d7ba7162420a3e3de6", "ja": "ああ、無事に終わってよかったよ。これも春香が\nしっかり予習してくれてたおかげかな。", "zh": "对啊，能顺利结束真是太好了。\n这也是多亏春香有事先做好预习呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "4af576bdc1f12e46bfa4c67da6eeb4136645666da4128c300f918621b726e0eb", "ja": "えへへ♪\n今回のロケは、私の好きなことばっかりでしたから！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪\n因为这次的外景行程，全都是我喜欢的事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "b689248caf24e8969ebf0731b3187c4cb1f1adf5bb39f35e8310c8979ced2f70", "ja": "すごいパティシエさんに、\n本場のお菓子作りを教えてもらえたり……。", "zh": "可以向厨艺精湛的甜点师，\n请教专业的点心制作方法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "61ed5594ab26e7ab5bbb10ad161012a15c59c966c95ed7af50b3a7e4192a7ddd", "ja": "お姫様が住んでそうなすごいお城で、\nライブもできちゃったり。すごく楽しかったです！", "zh": "还在像是公主所居住的气派城堡里，\n举办了演唱会，真的好开心喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "65c2b912dd57724bef4f85cbb523d46cf63b5ab266b867d31b5e40f3dab73a38", "ja": "そういえば、パティシエさんとは言葉が通じなかった\nのに、よくコミュニケーションが取れたな？", "zh": "说起来，你跟甜点师明明语言不通，\n居然还能互相沟通，真是厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "1d04ebcc6c59adbf715927df80eef7288b146e06983067de401ff98ea03ac314", "ja": "あ、それは……きっと、\n{$P$}さんのおかげです♪", "zh": "啊，这……一定是，\n托{$P$}先生的福♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1007_p", "source_sha256": "21cb4c56b703ed3568a93d153698ddc795234c43d5577e4da1c07f51d0dad598", "ja": "えっ、俺は何もしてないと思うけど？\n通訳したわけでもないし……。", "zh": "咦？我什么都没做啊，\n又不是说有帮你们翻译……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "641f980ae97a9ef0a4a66b41fcc1fd957ac20eba6ecc7780559d16ff160124b8", "ja": "えへへっ、そうなんですけどね。\nでも言葉に詰まった時に、思ったんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿，话是这么说没错，\n但我在不晓得该说什么的时候，心里会想──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "0543720cfe0bc7a15a4983e0efbf32ba1e8cd07396071c251dfb8ed6e594e138", "ja": "今、{$P$}さんに相談したら\nきっと「なんとかなる」って言ってくれるって。", "zh": "如果现在去找{$P$}先生商量的话，\n他一定会跟我说「总会有办法的」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "f8905b4b07bce3eab21e7451a9a56fff80cfc2de5bcb525984e0c6dd137a7a4b", "ja": "だから、なんとかしてみようって勇気がわいて……。\nそしたら、なんとかなっちゃいました！", "zh": "因为这样，才让我提起了设法尝试的勇气……\n然后，就真的找到办法了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fd5e327d7e9c5c613f0c4c81160ada173931719f579e77a4c9ebfee085490a29", "ja": "……はは、なるほど。でも、やっぱり俺は\n何もしてない気がするけどなぁ。", "zh": "……哈哈，是这样啊。\n不过，我还是觉得自己什么都没做呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "bf55dab0d26418a8243fb1b53ef9380e03d5358d6929d7a70b4b10138b36451c", "ja": "いいんですっ。私にとっては、\n{$P$}さんのおかげってことで！", "zh": "不用在意，反正对我来说，\n就是托{$P$}先生的福啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "896e06a35a1106937a48fea442a3b96ff510e57a3b25c21bd84355e75ebb8085", "ja": "あ、お家に帰ったら、\n教えてもらったお菓子、作ってみますね。", "zh": "啊，回到家以后，\n我会试着做做看这次学到的点心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0053_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "8390b3c0e7c5e51134106041420243e0fad2eedd7064dd3489f3ba30828c08df", "ja": "できたら劇場に持ってきますから……その時は\n味見してくださいね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "完成以后我会拿到剧场……到时候，\n就请你试试味道啰，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
